'' The rest of the outside-a-namespace rule: only a DEFINITION of something the namespace
'' declared may come from outside -- a second 'declare' of a declared procedure is fbc
'' error 158, and so is 'dim shared a.i1' over a member that was a plain dim rather than
'' an extern. An owner naming neither a namespace nor a type is 147 on a variable and 3
'' on a procedure. 'redim a' over a non-array is 63. Matches fbc on lines 17-20 and 23.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/outside-namespace-2.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' GOLDEN: expected/outside-namespace-2.out
